            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This depends on `config.search_method`. In 'mini.ai', default is `cover_or_next`, which does indeed result into `g()`, because it first searches within line. I personally and users of 'targets.vim' found this behavior more useful. This is by design.\r\n\r\nIf you set `config.search_method = 'cover'`, it does select parenthesis of `g()`.",
